  # Controller/Robot  :   UR5e
  # Software          :   URSCRIPT
  # Dependencies      :   Defines Script but mainly independend
  # How To            :   is used by projectconfig to create list of structs full of projectrelated information which are used across the scripts
  # ****************************************************
  # Author            :   D.Kreugel
