  #                       An der Riede 2
  #                       28816 Stuhr
  #                       Germany
  # ****************************************************
  # Description       :   definition of the datastructures used by the uLM, gives functionality to create a predefined datastructure, is assigned to a global list in projectconfig
  # Version           :   0.2
  # Created           :   18.07.2024
  # Updated           :
